                                                "sense_id": "6bf20f1c-c51c-31a4-bbc1-f469c27cba34",
                                                "text": "On November 18, 2011, the officer dispassionately pepper-sprayed a line of several nonviolent protesters sitting on the ground at the university, who flinched and covered their faces but remained passive with their arms interlocked, as onlookers shrieked and screamed out for the officer to stop."
                                            },
